  "description": "Isolated owner for Cevdet Erek’s positively documented solo davul approach. Existing davul forces zurna partnership, line-dance or mehter context; this record retains double-headed drum identity, source soft mallet/smaller implements and lowered tuning without inventing accompaniment or exact material species. Source supplies no chromatic pitch framework. Axes are authored routing values. No existing owner, family or engine edits.",
